          "type": "FMD5*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Digest",
          "type": "Byte*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "MD5 finalization. Ends an MD5 message-digest operation, writing the\nthe message digest and zeroizing the context.\nDigest is 16 BYTEs.\n@param digest\tpointer to a buffer where the digest should be stored ( must have at least 16 bytes )"
